        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda do Fluxo&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;1. Browser → Route 53 (DNS)&#xa;2. Route 53 → CloudFront (CDN)&#xa;3. CloudFront → S3 (Static Assets)&#xa;4. CloudFront → IGW → ALB (API)&#xa;5. ALB → ECS Fargate (Backend)&#xa;6. Fargate → RDS (Dados)&#xa;7. Fargate → SQS (Agendamentos)&#xa;8. Fargate → S3 (Fotos)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#E5E7EB;fillColor=#F9FAFB;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#374151;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
